<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p style="text-align: center;"><font size="2"><img src="https://qantas--c.ap1.content.force.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=0159000000FSVkd&amp;oid=00D900000010OOK&amp;lastMod=1521233610000" alt="Logo"></font></p><font size="2"><br><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Ref No: {!Case.CaseNumber}</font></p><font size="2"><br><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Dear {!Case.First_Name__c},</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Thank you for contacting us about your flight to {!Case.Arrival_City__c}.</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">We want all our customers to have an enjoyable journey when they travel with us, so regret your preferred meal choice was not available. We try to offer our customers a selection of meals, but we also need to balance this with our commitment to environmental, sustainability and waste reduction.</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Our catering teams estimate how many of each meal we will need on each flight using preference information gathered over the years. Please accept my apologies, on this occasion our estimates were incorrect and some customers did not get their first choice.</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><b><i><font size="2">-If remaining meal was unsuitable:-</font></i></b></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">I am sorry the other meal was unsuitable for you. If you have specific dietary requirements, you can request a specific type of meal ahead of time. Please let our Contact Centre know next time you book with us and we’ll do everything we can to make sure you have suitable food available.</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">We appreciate you taking the time to tell us about your experience and have passed your comments to our catering management for future menu reviews. I hope we have the opportunity to welcome you on board again in the future.</font></p><font size="2"><br><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Kind regards</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">{!User.FirstName}</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Qantas Customer Care</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2"><img src="https://qantas--c.ap1.content.force.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=0159000000FSVke&amp;oid=00D900000010OOK&amp;lastMod=1521233610000" alt="Qantas_Logo"></font></p><font size="2"><br><br></font><p style=""></p><p style="text-align: center;"><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: white;"><font size="2">{!Case.Thread_Token}</font></span></p><p style="text-align: center;"><font size="2">Qantas Airways Limited, ABN 16 009 661 901</font></p><p style="text-align: center;"><font size="2">10 Bourke Road Mascot NSW 2020 Australia</font></p><p style="text-align: center;"><br></p><p style="font-size: 12pt; text-align: center;"><span style="text-align: left; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">***************************** PLEASE CONSIDER OUR ENVIRONMENT BEFORE PRINTING *****************************&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p style="text-align: center;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" size="1" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="text-align: left;">*********************************************** Confidentiality and Privilege Notice **********************************************&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></font></p><p><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">This e-mail is intended only to be read or used by the addressee. It is confidential and may contain legally privileged information. If you are not the addressee indicated in this message (or responsible for delivery of the message to such person), you may not copy or deliver this message to anyone, and you should destroy this message and kindly notify the sender by reply e-mail. Confidentiality and legal privilege are not waived or lost by</span><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">&nbsp;</span><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">reason of mistaken delivery to you. Qantas Airways Limited ABN 16 009 661 901&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">***************************************************************************************************************************************</span></p>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>